{"path":"types/conditional","title":"std::conditional","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>conditional","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/conditional","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"Provides member typedef type, which is defined as T if B is true at compile time, or as F if B is false.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/type_traits\">&lt;type_traits&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> B, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> F <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> conditional<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Provides member typedef <code>type</code>, which is defined as <code>T</code> if <code>B</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> at compile time, or as <code>F</code> if <code>B</code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p><p>If the program adds specializations for <code>std::conditional</code>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_types\">Member types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-hitem\">\n<td>  Member type\n</td>\n<td>  Definition\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <code>type</code>\n</td>\n<td>  <code>T</code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">B <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, <code>F</code> if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">B <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_types\">Helper types</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx14\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> B, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> F <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">using</span> conditional_t <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"kw1\">typename</span> conditional<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>B,T,F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx14\">(since C++14)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> B, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> conditional <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> type <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> T<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T, <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> conditional<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span>, T, F<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> type <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> F<span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;type_traits&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;typeinfo&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Type1 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">conditional</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Type2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">conditional</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">using</span> Type3 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">conditional</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>sizeof<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> sizeof<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">type</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1773\">std::<span class=\"